| IOC Type | STIX Pattern |
|----------|-------------|
| IPv4 | `[ipv4-addr:value = '1.2.3.4']` |
| Domain | `[domain-name:value = 'evil.com']` |
| URL | `[url:value = 'https://evil.com']` |
