- [ ] Anti-forensic indicators (timestomping, log clearing) checked
- [ ] Findings documented with corroborating cross-source events$S$, '{"browse_web","http_get","shell_exec","create_deliverable"}', $S${"source":"mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills","pack":"cybersecurity","domain":"cybersecurity","subdomain":"digital-forensics","tags":["Design","Code","Testing","Analysis","Research","Automation","Security","Cloud","Data"],"files":2}$S$::jsonb, true)
