## Python Client
```python
import requests

class DefectDojoClient:
    def __init__(self, url, token):
        self.url = url.rstrip("/")
        self.headers = {"Authorization": "Token " + token}

    def get_findings(self, **params):
        return requests.get(
            f"{self.url}/api/v2/findings/",
            headers=self.headers, params=params
        ).json()
```
