## Exception States
| State | Description |
|-------|------------|
| draft | Initial creation, not yet submitted |
| pending_approval | Awaiting approval chain |
| approved | All approvers accepted |
| rejected | Any approver denied |
| expired | Past expiration date |
| revoked | Manually revoked |

