|----------|----------|
| Critical | Security Lead -> CISO -> Risk Committee |
| High | Security Lead -> CISO |
| Medium | Security Lead |
| Low | Security Lead |

## Maximum Exception Duration
| Severity | Max Days |
|----------|---------|
| Critical | 30 |
| High | 90 |
| Medium | 180 |
| Low | 365 |

