| Practice | RFC |
|----------|-----|
| PKCE (Proof Key for Code Exchange) | RFC 7636 |
| Token Binding | RFC 8471 |
| DPoP (Demonstrating Proof of Possession) | RFC 9449 |
| Sender-Constrained Tokens | OAuth 2.0 Security BCP |

