| DMZ | 3 | 1 (default) | Yes |
| GUEST | 1 | 2 | Yes |
| IOT | 1 | 3 | Yes |

### Security Controls
- pfBlockerNG: 12 IP blocklists + DNSBL enabled
- Snort IDS: Running on WAN and LAN interfaces
- VPN: OpenVPN remote access configured with MFA
- Logging: All traffic forwarded to SIEM (10.10.20.15)
